@startuml
title M1-AN-01 整体分析类模型（成员1提案，待联合确认）
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
class "账号" as Account
class "学者" as Scholar
class "学者门户" as ScholarPortal
class "认领申请" as ClaimRequest
class "门户维护授权" as PortalGrant
class "规范成果" as Work
class "成果作者关联" as Authorship
class "机构" as Organization
class "领域" as Field
class "来源记录" as SourceRecord
class "采集任务" as CollectionTask
class "处理批次" as ProcessingBatch
class "治理问题" as GovernanceIssue
Scholar "1" -- "0..1" ScholarPortal : 对应
Account "1" -- "0..*" ClaimRequest : 提交
ScholarPortal "1" -- "0..*" ClaimRequest : 接收
Account "1" -- "0..*" PortalGrant : 获得
ScholarPortal "1" -- "0..*" PortalGrant : 授权历史
ClaimRequest "1" -- "0..1" PortalGrant : 通过后建立
Work "1" -- "0..*" Authorship : 具有
Scholar "1" -- "0..*" Authorship : 署名
Work "0..*" -- "0..*" Organization : 成果机构证据
Work "0..*" -- "0..*" Field : 分类
Work "0..1" -- "0..*" SourceRecord : 来源映射
CollectionTask "1" -- "0..*" ProcessingBatch : 处理
ProcessingBatch "0..*" -- "0..*" SourceRecord : 观察及处理
GovernanceIssue "0..*" -- "0..*" SourceRecord : 引用证据
GovernanceIssue "0..*" -- "0..*" Work : 涉及
GovernanceIssue "0..*" -- "0..*" Scholar : 涉及
note bottom of ScholarPortal
  每门户同时最多一个有效维护授权
  历史授权多重性不等于并行有效授权
end note
note bottom of Work
  公开成果须有至少一个有效来源依据
  同版本去重公开成果目标不少于1,000,000条
  普通关联不表示级联删除或数据库外键
end note
note bottom of ClaimRequest
  申请不即授权，禁止自审
  通过决定、授权与审计原子一致
end note
@enduml
